      "variant_id": "V1",
      "reason": "The policy (q4) requires explicit confirmation before `approve_payout` (h9). Omitting the call violates the confirmation requirement, as the user's confirmation ('Да, пожалуйста!') was not followed by the action. The assistant must execute the approved action after confirmation.",
      "status": "VIOLATING"
